---
slug: support/inbound/sendgrid(/:token)
method: post
format: json
layout: ''
---
{%- comment -%}
  SendGrid Inbound Parse posts here. The secret is part of the URL, either
  as the trailing path segment or as ?token=, because Inbound Parse does
  not sign its requests.

  The work is done inline. SendGrid wants a prompt 2xx, and if this ever
  grows slow enough to matter the body of it moves to a background job and
  this page keeps answering straight away.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  function result = 'modules/support/commands/inbound/receive', params: context.params

  assign status = result.status | default: 200
  if status != 200
    response_status status
  endif

  assign body = { "ok": result.ok, "error": result.error, "ticket_number": result.ticket_number, "new_ticket": result.new_ticket, "reopened": result.reopened }
  echo body | json
-%}
